. * Phase 22: models, part 2 (systems and constraints, choice models, exact methods, nonlinear models,
. * frontier and treatment effects). Every command runs under capture noisily so that a difference in one
. * command does not stop the rest of the case; the layouts marked VERIFY in the code are settled by the
. * reference log. The data are built from rounded draws and from comparisons of runiform() draws (counts
. * are sums of Bernoulli draws, because rpoisson() and rbinomial() do not reproduce Stata's draws), with
. * real overdispersion and inefficiency so that no parameter sits at the boundary. Sums of rounded
. * terms avoid halves (even tenths as coefficients) and exact zeros, so that the rounding does not depend
. * on the last bit of a floating-point sum.
. program define mksys
  1.     clear
  2.     set seed 1908
  3.     set obs 400
  4.     gen double x1 = round(invnormal(runiform()), .01)
  5.     gen double x2 = round(invnormal(runiform()), .01)
  6.     gen double x3 = round(.5*x1 + invnormal(runiform()), .01)
  7.     gen double z1 = round(invnormal(runiform()), .01)
  8.     gen double z2 = round(invnormal(runiform()), .01)
  9.     gen double e1 = round(invnormal(runiform()), .01)
 10.     gen double e2 = round(.5*e1 + invnormal(runiform()), .01)
 11.     gen double y1 = round(1 + .8*x1 - .6*x2 + e1, .01)
 12.     gen double y2 = round(-1 + .6*x1 + .4*x3 + e2, .01)
 13.     gen double w = round(.5*z1 + .4*z2 + .3*x1 + .5*e1 + invnormal(runiform()), .01)
 14.     gen double y3 = round(1 + .8*w + .4*x1 + e1, .01)
 15.     gen double sdv = round(.5 + runiform(), .01)
 16.     gen double y4 = round(1 + .8*x1 - .5*x2 + sdv*invnormal(runiform()), .01)
 17.     gen double xt = round(x1 + .5*invnormal(runiform()), .01)
 18.     gen double y5 = round(1 + .8*x1 + 1.2*e1, .01)
 19.     replace y5 = y5 + 6 if _n <= 12
 20. end

. 
. mksys
number of observations (_N) was 0, now 400
